WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.835
In this lesson, you will learn to generate random quiz questions, keep score in a variable, and add a time limit with the timer.

2
00:00:12.435 --> 00:00:17.583
Store two random numbers in variables, then ask about them.

3
00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:22.296
Every time the quiz runs, the questions are different.

4
00:00:22.896 --> 00:00:26.739
Set score to 0 at the start.

5
00:00:26.739 --> 00:00:30.583
Each correct answer: change score by 1.

6
00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:33.991
At the end, say the score.

7
00:00:34.591 --> 00:00:40.609
Put the question code inside repeat (5) to ask five different questions.

8
00:00:41.209 --> 00:00:44.617
Reset the timer at the start.

9
00:00:44.617 --> 00:00:51.070
“wait until timer > 10” lets you end the game after 10 seconds.

10
00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:55.513
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:00:55.513 --> 00:01:00.661
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
